libphonenumber-jp

The numbering plan in src/data.ts (shipped as dist/*/data.js) is generated from
Google's libphonenumber:

    https://github.com/google/libphonenumber
    Copyright (C) 2009 The Libphonenumber Authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of that license is included at third_party/LICENSE-libphonenumber.

The parsing, formatting and validation algorithms follow those of
libphonenumber-js, which is itself a rewrite of Google's libphonenumber:

    https://github.com/catamphetamine/libphonenumber-js
    Copyright (c) 2016 @catamphetamine
    Licensed under the MIT License.

No code from either project is bundled: this package is an independent
implementation, narrowed to Japan.

